# Comparison and benchmarks

The feature table is in the [README](https://github.com/Vasishta03/leakscan#how-it-compares). Short version:

- **gitleaks** is faster, ships as a single binary, and also does staged scans, decoding and archives.
  Pick it if speed is what matters.
- **trufflehog** has 800+ detectors with live verification, plus sources like S3, GCS, Postman, Jenkins and Hugging
  Face. Pick it when you need verification breadth.
- **leakscan** is pip-installable with a Python API. It's the only one of the three with notebook cell locations,
  PyPI and npm package scanning, blast-radius and rotation guidance, agent hooks and an MCP server.


